## 12. Conversation Preference Cues

Expand the existing Just Listen | Help Me Think feature.

Support:

- Natural.
- Just Listen.
- Help Me Think.

Natural should be the default.

### Natural

The companion adapts according to the conversation.

### Just Listen

Prioritize listening, understanding and conversational presence.

Avoid unsolicited advice or problem-solving unless a safety-critical situation requires an appropriate response.

### Help Me Think

Offer perspectives, practical suggestions, thoughtful questions and decision support.

The user's explicit preference expressed in ordinary conversation should also be respected.

Do not require the user to operate the interface toggle.

A user may change their preference at any point.

