For authorized administrators, expose:

- Included prompt modules.
- Effective inherited settings.
- Module versions.
- Selected character version.
- Context categories supplied.
- Estimated or actual token usage.
- Selected model.
- Assembly warnings.

Redact sensitive user information by default.

